狱中自由谈论文学的权利——你可能很难理解这对我们来说有多重要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612600571","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["谈论文学是世上最快乐的事情，它不应该需要什么前提条件。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601206","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["虚构集小姐，你并不明白我们的处境。只要在这座监狱里，有些规则就是永远无法逃离的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601207","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["理想家……他总以为自己是这里唯一清醒的存在，认为那篇长诗和所谓的主义能带领大家冲破“视线”的牢笼。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612600572","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["理想家先生他并没有错……因为本能现实主义，本身就是一个能够让我们回归创作本质的好东西。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612600573","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在外面，许多像我一样的青年诗人，都相信它带来的力量。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601208","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是吗？加西亚先生，你是三个月前才进入科马拉监狱的，也是诗社中最晚到来的成员。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601209","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["请你告诉我们，在监狱外，你们本能现实主义派的运动进行得如何了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一旁，沉默许久的加西亚靠在了栏杆上，发出了金属振动与摩擦的响声。<br>他的嘴唇间有一根粗糙的卷纸条正在燃烧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["加西亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601310","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我们曾经吸引了许多有志青年，也的确发起了数场文学运动……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["加西亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601311","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在核心成员离开拉丁美洲的时候，我还是个孩子，我以为那无关紧要。事实却是——我们的运动再也没有任何起色了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["加西亚","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601312","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所有人都心知肚明：属于本能现实主义者的故事，在1977年就已经宣告完结了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612600574","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不……它没有结束，至少在我这里没有。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612600575","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["它依然存在着，哪怕世上只剩下我一个人在坚信它！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["奥克塔维奥并没有在意对方孩子气的发言。她知道，“坚信”有时柔弱得像一滴蜘蛛丝上的露水。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["奥克塔维奥","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"612601210","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["为什么你们总喜欢说“遵循自我”？